d with have not actually been tested for safety.","abilities":["Unblockable. Energy Capacity: 5; gains [Overload] upon reaching max Energy","[Overload] Greatly increases ASPD, DEF, and RES for a period of time."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":1.2,"stats":{"hp":7000,"atk":100,"def":120,"res":10,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2}},"delegation_veteran":{"slug":"delegation_veteran","name":"Delegation Veteran","icon":"/enemies-icons/Delegation Veteran.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Soldier whose fate is entwined with the delegation, employing hardened and ruthless tactics. They are on guard against potential escalation.","abilities":[],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.9,"stats":{"hp":7800,"atk":400,"def":200,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.7}},"nightzmora_imitator":{"slug":"nightzmora_imitator","name":"Nightzmora Imitator","icon":"/enemies-icons/Nightzmora Imitator.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Pretenders who began following Nightmare Knight after his battles and 'Performance Art'. Though the form is true, the substance is lacking. Perhaps they can be considered a type of fan as well.","abilities":["[Coalescing Fear] Deals Physical damage to all operators with no visibility directly behind them"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":50000,"atk":2000,"def":700,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"document":{"slug":"document","name":"Document","icon":"/enemies-icons/Document.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"Pith's student. Rational and good at math, with outstanding Originium Arts Assimilation. Chose to take to the battlefield as a defender operator to maintain an active mind.","abilities":["Takes greatly reduced Arts and Physical damage when force field is active; force field breaks when a large amount of damage is taken in a single instance"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":60000,"atk":1400,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"leafcarpet":{"slug":"leafcarpet","name":"Leafcarpet","icon":"/enemies-icons/Leafcarpet.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"An orphan that Sharp brought to Rhodes Island. When in peak condition, she is fast enough to give Sharp a run for his money, and was thus recruited into his squad. Not happy with how Sharp often goes solo.","abilities":["Unblockable","Accelerates when moving, stuns units along her path for a few seconds, and deals Physical damage based on her current Movement Speed","Temporarily gains a large Fragile effect if movement is interrupted"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.3,"stats":{"hp":100000,"atk":600,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":4}},"stopwatch":{"slug":"stopwatch","name":"Stopwatch","icon":"/enemies-icons/Stopwatch.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Touch's translator and a former Sami crook who decided to go straight and join Rhodes Island after being rescued by Touch. Claims to understand all the words that Touch leaves unsaid, which Touch neither affirms nor denies.","abilities":["Periodically increases the ASPD and Movement Speed of all enemies on the field when not blocked"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.4,"stats":{"hp":70000,"atk":2500,"def":